  dialogues:
  - text: Hold on there for a second.
    npcId: Halen
  - text: I just want you to know that i will have my confirm on voting to you.
    npcId: Halen
  - text: Also Mr.Vex tell me he was convince Sergent Ilda successfully.
    npcId: Halen
  - text: However, all others voters will vote for Sir Blackwood because of his wings.
    npcId: Halen
  - text: However, all others voters will vote for Sir Blackwood because of his wings.
    npcId: Halen
  - text: So your work right now are going to convince people in the village to vote
      to you, at least 10, because if there is a tie, the guild electing will be
      choosed.
    npcId: Halen
  - text: Just do as you work, meeting people through quest and have their trust.
    npcId: Halen
  - text: Those people have voting right will be highlight in the quest, and those
      will be put on tomorrow.
    npcId: Halen
